= Installation =

Once you have installed it, you just need to activate the plugin to enable it.

= Configuration =

OpenAI will add a new menu called "OpenAI" in your admin dashboard. From here you can configure all plugin settings there.

== Installation ==

1. Unzip the downloaded zip file.
2. Upload the plugin folder into the `wp-content/plugins/` directory of your WordPress site.
3. Activate `OpenAI` from Plugins page
